// Imported by tests/fail/import_str_alias.wk. A type alias named `str`, the built-in type. The
// loader renames it `lib.str_alias.str`; alias expansion must still see the name this module wrote
// (E0300), or every `str` in this module silently means `i32`.
module lib.str_alias

